    "originalSource": "Public Sub ResumeForms(resumeType As Integer)\n    On Error GoTo ErrorHandler\n\n    ' A statement that may raise an error\n    Debug.Print 1 / resumeType\n\nResumeTarget:\n    Exit Sub\n\nErrorHandler:\n    Select Case resumeType\n        Case 1\n            Resume\n        Case 2\n            Resume Next\n        Case 3\n            Resume ResumeTarget\n    End Select\nEnd Sub"
